1
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,700
=The Road to Splendor=

2
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

3
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:38,000
=Episode 33=

4
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:56,000
There is no need for pleasantries
between us.

5
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,680
In a way, this misfortune has turned
into a blessing for you.

6
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,799
At least, you no longer
have me as a rival.

7
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,920
You've repeatedly made insinuations

8
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,159
about my background.

9
00:02:05,879 --> 00:02:07,000
But do you know

10
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,919
what trained courtesans
like me truly went through?

11
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,919
There were five other girls

12
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,280
bought into the household with me.

13
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,520
When I was eight or nine,

14
00:02:19,039 --> 00:02:20,039
one of them

15
00:02:20,199 --> 00:02:21,560
was sold off as a servant

16
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,759
because she wasn't pretty enough.

17
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,360
Another girl was trained in dancing,

18
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:28,479
but starvation ruined her health.

19
00:02:28,639 --> 00:02:29,680
She never reached adulthood.

20
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:31,960
And another

21
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,120
was abused by the family
she was sent to,

22
00:02:34,599 --> 00:02:35,960
and died after a miscarriage.

23
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:39,919
Madam,

24
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:42,560
you are not truly a wicked person.

25
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:45,280
You only wanted to earn
everyone's respect.

26
00:02:46,599 --> 00:02:47,479
So,

27
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:49,639
in your eyes,

28
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:50,759
the cruelest things

29
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:52,479
were nothing more than

30
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,039
petty tricks meant to embarrass others.

31
00:02:58,759 --> 00:03:00,240
Compared with the other girls,

32
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:03,120
I was already one of the lucky ones.

33
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,439
Miss Fan,

34
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,039
on your journey,

35
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:12,680
please take care of yourself.

36
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:15,439
And I hope that one day

37
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,479
you can break free
from this confined world.

38
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:28,520
(No wonder Madam Zhao said)

39
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:31,000
(who you are born as may matter,)

40
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,919
(and who you marry may matter too,)

41
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,560
(but what matters most)

42
00:03:37,759 --> 00:03:39,479
(is who you ultimately become.)

43
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,800
(I hope we)

44
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:45,719
(can all find freedom someday.)

45
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:04,960
Madam,

46
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:08,240
the Young Madam Yu didn't take any gold
or jewelry with her.

47
00:04:09,319 --> 00:04:11,919
She only took the ten chests
of manuscripts she brought as dowry.

48
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,560
Perhaps...

49
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,840
she finally understood.

50
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:18,519
From beginning to end,

51
00:04:19,639 --> 00:04:22,000
all she wanted was for others
to respect her.

52
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,879
She never cared about gold and silver.

53
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,439
The Yu family could never hold her back.

54
00:04:29,519 --> 00:04:31,240
Since she wants freedom,

55
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,519
let her go.

56
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,560
Cairong,

57
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:45,120
sell all the gold jewelry I've saved.

58
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:46,639
Exchange them all for silver notes.

59
00:04:47,879 --> 00:04:48,720
Why?

60
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,079
Those are your dignity
when you leave the house.

61
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,199
Don't be foolish.

62
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,639
Today it is her.

63
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,560
But who knows...

64
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:58,240
tomorrow it won't be me?

65
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:01,519
Keep only gold-plated pieces

66
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,360
for appearances.

67
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,519
When a real crisis comes,

68
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:06,720
those ornaments

69
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,639
won't save my life.

70
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,360
Only those silver notes

71
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:11,240
are a true lifeline.

72
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:23,680
Grand Secretary Tian,

73
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:25,360
I hope you'll forgive my boldness,

74
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,879
but before you retire,

75
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,360
I'd like to ask you
to submit a memorial.

76
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:31,480
Commander Zhao,

77
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,399
I,

78
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:35,000
after serving in office for decades,

79
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,680
have survived by knowing
when to stay out of trouble.

80
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,639
Those words have been my rule.

81
00:05:39,199 --> 00:05:40,839
This mess you're stepping into,

82
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:42,399
I won't get involved.

83
00:05:44,759 --> 00:05:45,920
The old salt administration case

84
00:05:46,519 --> 00:05:47,439
does have suspicious circumstances.

85
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,519
The evidence points directly
to the Yu family.

86
00:05:51,079 --> 00:05:52,040
If you were to speak,

87
00:05:52,319 --> 00:05:53,519
instead of someone like me,

88
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:57,120
the difference in influence
would be immeasurable.

89
00:05:58,199 --> 00:06:00,240
All I ask is that you submit
one memorial on my behalf.

90
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,879
I'll handle

91
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,439
the dirty work and the hard work
that follows.

92
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:05,199
It will root out corruption

93
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:07,319
and replenish the imperial treasury.

94
00:06:08,279 --> 00:06:09,399
It will benefit both the court
and the people.

95
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,360
Of course,

96
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:13,920
I

97
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:17,439
do have my own motives.

98
00:06:18,639 --> 00:06:19,959
But for you, Master Tian,

99
00:06:20,879 --> 00:06:22,399
this would also allow your name

100
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,600
to leave a distinguished mark
in history.

101
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,800
Commander Zhao, let me tell you,

102
00:06:31,079 --> 00:06:34,360
I'm 58 years old.

103
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,079
In just a few years,

104
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,759
I'll be heading home to retire.

105
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:39,800
And you're here

106
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,759
trying to sell me a dream?

107
00:06:46,399 --> 00:06:48,160
In this life,

108
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,800
the more one craves,

109
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,680
the harder the fall when it's lost.

110
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:53,680
Power,

111
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,839
you may seek it,

112
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,879
but never cling to it.

113
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,240
As for me,

114
00:06:59,399 --> 00:07:00,639
I have enough.

115
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:08,920
Well,

116
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,720
I'm afraid I'm rather tired.

117
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,920
I won't keep you any longer,
Commander Zhao.

118
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,240
Young man,

119
00:07:14,399 --> 00:07:15,759
you should be on your way.

120
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,000
How did it go?

121
00:07:36,879 --> 00:07:37,920
He doesn't crave power.

122
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,439
He doesn't seek wealth.

123
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:42,399
Even the chance to be remembered
in history couldn't move him.

124
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,199
For now, I truly can't find

125
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:47,600
anything that would persuade him.

126
00:07:49,759 --> 00:07:51,480
Even the Buddha

127
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,279
sought to save all sentient beings.

128
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,560
I refuse to believe that in this world

129
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:59,120
there is truly someone

130
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,319
who has completely severed all desires.

131
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,759
The Tian family...

132
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:07,240
what is it they truly seek?

133
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,720
Grand Secretary Tian
has retired from office.

134
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,759
As for Madam Yu's generation,

135
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,399
they have little left to worry about.

136
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,879
But

137
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,800
what about when their eldest daughter
comes of age?

138
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,600
Women cannot take the examinations
or enter government service.

139
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,240
You certainly wouldn't want her confined
to the inner chambers.

140
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,439
Nor would you bear to see her

141
00:08:25,439 --> 00:08:27,279
spend her life tending to her in-laws
and household chores.

142
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,279
Then in the future,

143
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:30,399
what path will she have?

144
00:08:31,759 --> 00:08:32,919
How do you know

145
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,320
I haven't planned for her future?

146
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,639
Madam comes from a distinguished family.

147
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:39,159
You do not chase power,

148
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,519
nor covet wealth,

149
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:42,879
yet patiently

150
00:08:42,879 --> 00:08:44,519
organize this gathering every month.

151
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,320
I believe

152
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,559
it is probably to

153
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,200
pave the way for your daughter.

154
00:08:50,799 --> 00:08:52,759
So that the connections

155
00:08:52,759 --> 00:08:53,480
and resources

156
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,440
you have built can be passed on to her.

157
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:59,679
If I could invite Grand Empress Dowager
to attend in person,

158
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,519
then Madam's gathering

159
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:02,960
would gain even greater prestige.

160
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:05,279
And the reputation passed
on to your daughter

161
00:09:05,559 --> 00:09:06,559
would be all the more elevated.

162
00:09:09,879 --> 00:09:11,320
Can you truly make that happen?

163
00:09:11,919 --> 00:09:12,840
I

164
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,159
will do my best to try.

165
00:09:23,519 --> 00:09:25,720
I recently came across
an extraordinary book,

166
00:09:26,879 --> 00:09:29,120
and have brought it here
for Your Majesty's appreciation.

167
00:09:30,560 --> 00:09:31,600
(Dongshan Poetry Talks)

168
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:33,679
This book

169
00:09:33,799 --> 00:09:36,039
was compiled by the renowned
scholar Fan Kun

170
00:09:36,039 --> 00:09:36,840
and is titled

171
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,960
Dongshan Poetry Talks.

172
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:43,399
The binding is quite elegant.

173
00:09:43,759 --> 00:09:45,279
What makes this book remarkable

174
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,279
is that

175
00:09:46,759 --> 00:09:48,159
it contains commentary
from both father and daughter.

176
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,480
The notes in black on the left

177
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,919
were written by Fan Kun.

178
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,759
The notes in red on the right

179
00:09:54,919 --> 00:09:56,679
are the insights of Fan Yake.

180
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,120
I happened to obtain this book

181
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:01,399
at Madam Wei's literary gathering.

182
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,360
After reading it carefully,

183
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,399
I found it truly remarkable.

184
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,159
Therefore,

185
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,960
I present it to Your Majesty.

186
00:10:07,399 --> 00:10:08,840
Compared with her father,

187
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,480
I find that

188
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,320
the daughter's perspectives

189
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:14,320
are much more to my liking.

190
00:10:14,799 --> 00:10:17,159
For a woman to possess such talent

191
00:10:17,519 --> 00:10:18,720
is truly rare.

192
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,799
If Your Majesty

193
00:10:21,799 --> 00:10:23,600
would be willing to bring
the court ladies with you

194
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,399
and attend the literary gathering
in the capital,

195
00:10:26,039 --> 00:10:27,320
and have this grand occasion

196
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,559
recorded in the Imperial Daily Records,

197
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,559
it would encourage women
to pursue learning

198
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:34,200
and add another distinguished chapter
to Your Majesty's legacy.

199
00:10:35,039 --> 00:10:36,039
Would that not be

200
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,200
a wonderful thing?

201
00:10:43,679 --> 00:10:44,720
Excellent.

202
00:10:49,759 --> 00:10:50,879
I've heard that

203
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,679
women in the Northwest

204
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,279
can both

205
00:10:54,279 --> 00:10:55,840
ride horses and shoot arrows,

206
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,120
and also

207
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,720
work the fields

208
00:10:58,879 --> 00:11:00,320
and prepare supplies for the army.

209
00:11:01,559 --> 00:11:02,960
The capital

210
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:05,440
may not have the vast beauty
of the Gobi Desert,

211
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:09,039
but it has its own elegance
and refinement.

212
00:11:09,799 --> 00:11:12,000
I came out of the palace today

213
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,559
because I wanted to see

214
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:17,759
how the young ladies of the capital

215
00:11:18,159 --> 00:11:19,440
usually

216
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:22,639
spend their time.

217
00:11:22,879 --> 00:11:25,440
Greetings, Your Majesty.

218
00:11:26,279 --> 00:11:27,440
Rise.

219
00:11:27,759 --> 00:11:30,080
Thank you, Your Majesty.

220
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:33,000
Your Majesty,

221
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:34,720
the capital

222
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,360
is a place where culture flourishes.

223
00:11:36,639 --> 00:11:38,039
The ladies here

224
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,600
may not be skilled at riding horses

225
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,399
or archery,

226
00:11:40,679 --> 00:11:42,799
but they often compose poetry and paint,

227
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,080
host literary gatherings,

228
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,320
and form poetry societies.

229
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:47,000
So,

230
00:11:47,519 --> 00:11:48,679
is this

231
00:11:48,799 --> 00:11:50,720
the gathering you host?

232
00:11:52,279 --> 00:11:53,519
Your Majesty,

233
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,159
I merely

234
00:11:55,159 --> 00:11:56,840
provide a place for everyone to gather.

235
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,840
It is only thanks to the support
and kindness of the ladies here.

236
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,679
Very good.

237
00:12:03,919 --> 00:12:05,279
Very good indeed.

238
00:12:07,519 --> 00:12:09,600
Come, show me around the rest
of the place.

239
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,279
This way, Your Majesty.

240
00:12:12,799 --> 00:12:14,279
(Spring, the 7th year of Hongzhi.)

241
00:12:14,519 --> 00:12:17,679
(Grand Empress Dowager left the palace
to attend Madam Wei's gathering.)

242
00:12:17,879 --> 00:12:18,759
(She was greatly pleased)

243
00:12:18,919 --> 00:12:20,360
(and praised the event.)

244
00:12:20,639 --> 00:12:22,240
Even the Grand Empress Dowager
came in person.

245
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:24,039
Madam Wei certainly
has quite a reputation.

246
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:26,159
Madam Zhao truly knows
how to make things happen.

247
00:12:26,639 --> 00:12:27,519
Rest assured.

248
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:29,279
Whatever Commander Zhao plans to do,

249
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:31,519
I'll persuade my father to step forward.

250
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:41,400
(Xie Jewelry Shop)

251
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,039
This pearl

252
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,320
is of excellent quality.

253
00:12:51,519 --> 00:12:52,480
Its estimated value

254
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:54,039
is around ten thousand taels each.

255
00:12:54,639 --> 00:12:55,879
Ten thousand taels?

256
00:12:55,879 --> 00:12:57,240
It truly is a priceless treasure.

257
00:12:57,799 --> 00:12:59,279
Such a rare find.

258
00:12:59,559 --> 00:13:02,240
Who could afford to buy
it at that price?

259
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,519
However, if

260
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,279
we could find another pearl

261
00:13:05,279 --> 00:13:06,519
of the same quality

262
00:13:06,639 --> 00:13:07,639
to make a matching pair,

263
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:09,320
its value

264
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,399
would increase by at least three times.

265
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:14,159
Three times?

266
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:17,159
So if anyone's household
has a similar pearl,

267
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:20,039
Xie Jewelry Shop is willing to buy it
for twice the market price.

268
00:13:21,039 --> 00:13:22,480
Three times the value...

269
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,919
(Yu)
So beautiful.

270
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,039
This...

271
00:13:25,279 --> 00:13:26,559
Isn't this the box

272
00:13:26,559 --> 00:13:27,919
Grand Secretary Yu sent over

273
00:13:27,919 --> 00:13:29,080
when he came to apologize last time?

274
00:13:29,399 --> 00:13:30,399
Could it be

275
00:13:30,399 --> 00:13:32,679
that Grand Secretary Yu gave it
to the owner of Xie Jewelry Shop?

276
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:35,440
Grand Secretary Yu has always
prided himself on his integrity.

277
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:36,759
Who would have thought that
when he makes a gift,

278
00:13:36,759 --> 00:13:38,360
he would offer something so valuable.

279
00:13:38,679 --> 00:13:39,720
Indeed.

280
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:42,000
(Yu Residence)

281
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,799
If we go out now and say it wasn't
from us,

282
00:13:43,799 --> 00:13:44,960
no one will believe us.

283
00:13:45,039 --> 00:13:46,519
The whole capital is already
talking about it.

284
00:13:46,759 --> 00:13:47,960
They say the Yu family
is immensely wealthy,

285
00:13:48,039 --> 00:13:49,759
and that we give extravagant gifts.

286
00:13:50,279 --> 00:13:51,360
That woman Fu...

287
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,480
she turned a fake performance
into reality.

288
00:13:52,679 --> 00:13:54,120
That was truly a vicious move.

289
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,120
She never once said

290
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,480
that it was a gift from the Yu family.

291
00:13:57,960 --> 00:14:00,279
Yet she let the rumors spread
through the streets.

292
00:14:00,279 --> 00:14:02,679
Now we can't even explain ourselves.

293
00:14:02,679 --> 00:14:04,399
She used the gift I gave
to build her own reputation,

294
00:14:04,399 --> 00:14:05,639
and turned it into a weapon against us.

295
00:14:05,879 --> 00:14:07,120
This isn't a counterattack.

296
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,399
It's a provocation.

297
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,840
I warned you long ago

298
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:14,639
not to send an empty box.

299
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:20,279
This is not the time for such remarks.

300
00:14:20,279 --> 00:14:21,120
Madam.

301
00:14:21,399 --> 00:14:23,799
The entire capital is watching
the Yu family now.

302
00:14:23,919 --> 00:14:25,399
Everyone is saying how wealthy we are.

303
00:14:25,519 --> 00:14:26,519
Under normal circumstances,

304
00:14:26,799 --> 00:14:29,639
His Majesty would
simply turn a blind eye.

305
00:14:29,639 --> 00:14:31,279
But the court is in desperate
need of funds right now.

306
00:14:31,399 --> 00:14:32,519
What Fu did

307
00:14:33,159 --> 00:14:34,480
was to put the Yu family

308
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,759
right in the line of fire.

309
00:14:36,759 --> 00:14:37,759
And Zhao Ling...

310
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:40,159
I don't know what tricks he pulled,

311
00:14:40,159 --> 00:14:41,519
but he managed to persuade Tian.

312
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:44,039
He could have simply retired
with dignity.

313
00:14:44,039 --> 00:14:45,039
But right before leaving,

314
00:14:45,039 --> 00:14:46,279
he submitted a memorial and set me up.

315
00:14:46,279 --> 00:14:47,360
He wants to establish some kind of

316
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,480
Salt Tax Office.

317
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,279
The handover alone
will take half a year.

318
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:51,159
By then,

319
00:14:51,159 --> 00:14:52,200
that old fox

320
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,519
will be back in the countryside fishing!

321
00:14:55,399 --> 00:14:57,080
I heard Grand Secretary Tian

322
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,639
specifically included in the regulations

323
00:14:58,639 --> 00:14:59,759
that officials from the Six Ministries
be assigned.

324
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:03,159
He's trying to remove all our people.

325
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:05,080
Exactly, Madam.

326
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:07,519
Don't blame me for being anxious.

327
00:15:08,279 --> 00:15:10,440
Once the salt accounts are handed over,

328
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,840
the things we've been hiding...

329
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:16,320
Anyway,

330
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,879
those dirty accounts...

331
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:20,120
Zhao Ling is determined to dig them up.

332
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,440
And now the woman Fu

333
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:22,080
has given us

334
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,080
another

335
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,200
mess to deal with.

336
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:32,399
(Hold Fast to the Mean)
I have reviewed the salt regulations

337
00:15:32,399 --> 00:15:33,200
drafted by Tian.

338
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:34,159
Very good.

339
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,200
The key point

340
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:38,320
lies in the appointment
of the Salt Tax Office officials.

341
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,240
Your Majesty,

342
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:44,159
I humbly offer

343
00:15:44,159 --> 00:15:44,919
myself for the position

344
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,159
to oversee this matter.

345
00:15:50,919 --> 00:15:52,759
There have been some rumors
in the capital recently.

346
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,279
I have heard about them as well.

347
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:57,240
Minister Yu, perhaps you should
settle your own accounts first

348
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:58,960
before concerning yourself
with the salt administration accounts.

349
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:03,039
This matter will be handled
by Minister Zhao.

350
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:06,240
I obey.

351
00:16:10,159 --> 00:16:11,159
In this world,

352
00:16:11,159 --> 00:16:13,320
the easiest thing to manipulate
is the human heart.

353
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:16,399
Fu Tingyun wants to make the Yu family
the target of everyone's anger.

354
00:16:17,279 --> 00:16:20,200
Zhao Ling wants to place his own people
in the Salt Tax Office.

355
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,639
Then perhaps we should make a move
of our own.

356
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,039
Cut off the problem at its root.

357
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,658
(Yan Merchant Guild)

358
00:16:44,659 --> 00:16:45,440
(Hall of Worthy Gatherings)

359
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:46,159
Mr. Jin,

360
00:16:46,279 --> 00:16:48,440
if the court really establishes
the Salt Tax Office,

361
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,600
then in the future, salt permits

362
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,480
will have to be purchased with money

363
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:51,919
directly from the Ministry of Revenue.

364
00:16:51,919 --> 00:16:54,320
Won't that mean we'll need even
stronger connections to survive?

365
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:56,120
But we have Mr. Jin.

366
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,240
Mr. Jin,

367
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,559
give us a hint.

368
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:01,399
Will our future backer

369
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:03,120
still be Zhao?

370
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:04,839
Commander Zhao has already
risen in rank.

371
00:17:04,839 --> 00:17:06,720
He is now a third rank official.

372
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:07,519
Mr. Jin,

373
00:17:07,799 --> 00:17:09,799
are you sure you still

374
00:17:09,799 --> 00:17:11,000
have influence with Commander Zhao?

375
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,480
Mr. Jin, just give us a straight answer.

376
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:14,400
Can we still stay in the salt business?

377
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:15,359
Yes, Mr. Jin.

378
00:17:15,359 --> 00:17:17,279
Our families and dozens of workers

379
00:17:17,279 --> 00:17:18,319
all depend on this for a living.

380
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:19,319
Mr. Jin!

381
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:21,480
Mr. Jin! Mr. Jin!

382
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:22,599
A distinguished guest

383
00:17:22,599 --> 00:17:24,319
has invited you to Qingfeng Teahouse.

384
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,960
I, Jin Yuanbao, a humble commoner,

385
00:17:43,559 --> 00:17:44,720
and I pay my respects to Madam Yu.

386
00:17:52,759 --> 00:17:53,559
I never expected

387
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:55,400
Grand Secretary Yu himself would come.

388
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,400
I am deeply honored!

389
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:00,880
Mr. Jin, no need for formalities.

390
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:02,279
Please, rise.

391
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:04,519
Have a seat.

392
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,240
My Lord.

393
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:06,440
Have a seat.

394
00:18:09,759 --> 00:18:11,279
I invited you here today

395
00:18:11,519 --> 00:18:13,200
because I have a good opportunity
for you.

396
00:18:14,559 --> 00:18:15,759
As you know,

397
00:18:15,839 --> 00:18:16,880
since the establishment

398
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,240
of the Salt Tax Office,

399
00:18:18,839 --> 00:18:20,359
all salt permits across the realm

400
00:18:21,079 --> 00:18:23,359
must now be obtained by paying silver.

401
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:28,359
If Mr. Jin is willing to testify

402
00:18:29,319 --> 00:18:32,359
and expose Zhao Ling's past involvement
in private salt trading,

403
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:34,559
and reveal how he colluded
with merchants

404
00:18:35,119 --> 00:18:37,599
and exploited salt merchants,

405
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:39,440
I guarantee

406
00:18:40,839 --> 00:18:42,759
all salt permits in the entire Northwest

407
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:45,880
every share of the salt quota

408
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,519
will belong to you, Mr. Jin.

409
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:49,000
From this day forward,

410
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:52,640
you will become the biggest
salt merchant in the Northwest.

411
00:18:55,039 --> 00:18:55,920
My Lord.

412
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,039
This... this...

413
00:18:57,519 --> 00:18:59,200
This cannot be done.

414
00:19:00,599 --> 00:19:02,359
This would be a false accusation.

415
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:04,279
Falsely accusing a court official

416
00:19:04,279 --> 00:19:05,839
will get me a beating.

417
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:06,720
And besides,

418
00:19:06,839 --> 00:19:08,319
if the charge is official-merchant
collusion,

419
00:19:08,319 --> 00:19:10,519
the merchant involved
will be punished as well.

420
00:19:10,839 --> 00:19:11,519
Impossible.

421
00:19:11,519 --> 00:19:12,519
Back in those days,

422
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:14,759
you did business with Zhao Ling.

423
00:19:15,079 --> 00:19:17,799
You must have seen the Zhao family's
land deeds and property records.

424
00:19:18,279 --> 00:19:20,119
You must have seen his personal seal
as well.

425
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,160
Those will serve as evidence.

426
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:23,920
They will turn this case

427
00:19:24,119 --> 00:19:25,400
into an airtight case.

428
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:27,640
Then it won't be a false
accusation anymore.

429
00:19:27,839 --> 00:19:28,599
Second,

430
00:19:29,119 --> 00:19:30,960
you won't have to bear
the risk yourself.

431
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:33,359
Pick someone among your business
associates

432
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,279
and let him take the blame.

433
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,480
Madam.

434
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:40,480
My Lord.

435
00:19:40,759 --> 00:19:42,640
Perhaps you don't know this,

436
00:19:43,279 --> 00:19:45,240
but Commander Zhao and I

437
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,200
are like brothers.

438
00:19:47,559 --> 00:19:48,359
This matter...

439
00:19:49,559 --> 00:19:50,519
Is that so?

440
00:19:51,119 --> 00:19:53,319
Then why weren't you invited
to his victory banquet?

441
00:19:55,519 --> 00:19:57,160
Between officials and merchants,

442
00:19:57,920 --> 00:20:00,480
how could there ever be true friendship?

443
00:20:02,519 --> 00:20:03,799
The two of you

444
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:08,440
have long been walking different paths.

445
00:20:16,079 --> 00:20:17,160
Don't worry.

446
00:20:18,279 --> 00:20:19,720
If this succeeds,

447
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:21,640
Zhao Ling

448
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:24,400
will at worst be demoted and sent away.

449
00:20:24,839 --> 00:20:25,880
But you...

450
00:20:26,039 --> 00:20:29,519
you'll gain real wealth
and tangible benefits.

451
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:34,759
I heard there's a merchant
called Shopkeeper Ye.

452
00:20:34,759 --> 00:20:36,599
He's privately been

453
00:20:36,599 --> 00:20:37,640
complaining quite a lot to you.

454
00:20:48,079 --> 00:20:48,680
Mr. Jin.

455
00:20:49,039 --> 00:20:49,559
You wanted to see me?

456
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,440
What did you call me?

457
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,000
Mr. Jin.

458
00:20:54,079 --> 00:20:54,920
Call me brother.

459
00:20:55,599 --> 00:20:56,279
Bro Yuanbao.

460
00:20:56,559 --> 00:20:57,440
Remember this.

461
00:20:57,759 --> 00:20:59,720
I'll always be your Brother Yuanbao.

462
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:04,079
I called you here today

463
00:21:04,079 --> 00:21:05,480
because I need your help with something.

464
00:21:06,079 --> 00:21:08,960
In a few days, it's Brother Yucheng's
memorial ceremony.

465
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:11,000
I had

466
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,319
a solid gold incense burner made.

467
00:21:12,519 --> 00:21:13,880
I don't trust anyone else to handle it.

468
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:15,440
You're young and quick on your feet.

469
00:21:15,519 --> 00:21:16,599
Go to Yuzhou for me

470
00:21:16,599 --> 00:21:17,160
and bring it back.

471
00:21:17,599 --> 00:21:18,920
Solid gold?

472
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:21,039
You're really willing
to spend that much?

473
00:21:23,039 --> 00:21:24,559
It's for Brother Yucheng.

474
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:26,200
He's one of our own.

475
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:29,279
Don't worry.

476
00:21:29,519 --> 00:21:30,559
I'll make it in time.

477
00:21:30,839 --> 00:21:32,119
Before the wedding,

478
00:21:32,119 --> 00:21:33,119
I'll definitely be back.

479
00:21:33,119 --> 00:21:33,480
Good.

480
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:34,640
Leave it to me.

481
00:21:36,960 --> 00:21:38,680
I may have no parents,

482
00:21:38,759 --> 00:21:40,440
but luckily I have brothers like you.

483
00:21:41,160 --> 00:21:42,440
Every one of you treats me
better than the last.

484
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,920
Mr. Zhao was asking about you
the other day.

485
00:21:50,799 --> 00:21:52,480
He said you hadn't stopped by
in a long time.

486
00:21:56,559 --> 00:21:57,279
I've been busy.

487
00:21:57,839 --> 00:21:58,799
The salt reform is about to begin.

488
00:21:58,799 --> 00:21:59,920
Things are still uncertain.

489
00:22:00,319 --> 00:22:01,480
I don't want to trouble Mr. Zhao.

490
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:02,599
I'll be going then.

491
00:22:02,599 --> 00:22:03,039
Yuanbao.

492
00:22:03,039 --> 00:22:03,480
Go on.

493
00:22:05,119 --> 00:22:05,960
Take care.

494
00:22:10,599 --> 00:22:12,319
Honorable Magistrate,

495
00:22:12,799 --> 00:22:14,319
I, Jin Yuanbao, a humble commoner,

496
00:22:15,119 --> 00:22:15,880
hereby accuse

497
00:22:16,039 --> 00:22:17,880
Zhao Ling, General Zhaoyong,

498
00:22:18,119 --> 00:22:19,519
of colluding with merchants,

499
00:22:19,519 --> 00:22:20,839
engaging in illegal salt trading,

500
00:22:21,319 --> 00:22:22,240
and forcing salt merchants

501
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:23,920
to pay him profits and bribes.

502
00:22:25,160 --> 00:22:25,839
All

503
00:22:26,079 --> 00:22:27,440
financial transactions

504
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:29,039
property records and land deeds

505
00:22:29,119 --> 00:22:30,640
bear his personal seal!

506
00:22:32,680 --> 00:22:33,319
Your Majesty,

507
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:35,640
Since the salt reform was implemented
on a trial basis in Anzhou,

508
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:37,920
it has brought in an additional two
hundred thousand taels for the treasury.

509
00:22:38,359 --> 00:22:39,759
These are the reports

510
00:22:39,759 --> 00:22:41,200
and account records submitted
by the local officials,

511
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,200
along with their reports of success.

512
00:22:44,840 --> 00:22:47,640
(Memorial: Report on the Success
of the New Salt Reform in Anzhou)

513
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:50,360
(Report on Salt Official Zhao Ling's
Deception, Embezzlement and Bribery)

514
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:55,560
(Report on Impeiral Salt Inspector
Shen Congsi's Death While in Office)

515
00:23:00,119 --> 00:23:01,359
Your handling of affairs,
Grand Secretary,

516
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:03,160
has greatly pleased me.

517
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:07,000
Your Majesty,

518
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:08,640
I have another matter to report.

519
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:11,599
A salt merchant has come forward

520
00:23:12,119 --> 00:23:13,279
to accuse Zhao Ling

521
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:15,480
not only of colluding with merchants,

522
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:16,759
but also of coercing them
into paying bribes.

523
00:23:16,759 --> 00:23:17,440
More than that,

524
00:23:18,279 --> 00:23:19,200
this man

525
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:21,640
was once a salt smuggler.

526
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:24,480
Yet

527
00:23:24,480 --> 00:23:25,720
he concealed his past,

528
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:26,640
infiltrated the army,

529
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:27,920
and deceived the throne.

530
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:30,440
We now have

531
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:31,920
land deeds and property records bearing
Zhao Ling's personal seal as evidence.

532
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,559
Please examine them, Your Majesty.

533
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:39,680
Your Majesty,

534
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:40,960
a high-ranking official of the court

535
00:23:41,039 --> 00:23:42,400
has actually falsified his identity.

536
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:44,720
This is a grave crime
of deceiving the throne.

537
00:23:45,119 --> 00:23:46,640
The question is, was he truly capable
of hiding this so well,

538
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:47,839
that he deceived everyone,

539
00:23:47,960 --> 00:23:48,839
or

540
00:23:49,519 --> 00:23:50,319
did someone

541
00:23:50,319 --> 00:23:51,839
deliberately shield and enable him?

542
00:23:52,240 --> 00:23:53,720
I beg Your Majesty
to investigate thoroughly.

543
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:55,640
Your Majesty,

544
00:23:55,920 --> 00:23:57,960
the new salt policy has only
been tested in Anzhou,

545
00:23:58,200 --> 00:23:59,880
yet it has already generated two hundred
thousand taels in revenue.

546
00:24:00,039 --> 00:24:01,240
If implemented nationwide,

547
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:02,799
it could bring in millions.

548
00:24:03,039 --> 00:24:03,960
And yet now,

549
00:24:04,519 --> 00:24:05,680
the person in charge
of the salt administration

550
00:24:05,759 --> 00:24:08,440
is a former salt smuggler
who deceived the throne.

551
00:24:09,039 --> 00:24:10,799
How can the people trust such a policy?

552
00:24:10,799 --> 00:24:12,559
And how can this new salt reform

553
00:24:12,559 --> 00:24:13,559
be carried forward?

554
00:24:16,279 --> 00:24:17,000
Your Majesty,

555
00:24:18,119 --> 00:24:19,240
I believe

556
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:24,400
the salt reform should be suspended

557
00:24:24,759 --> 00:24:26,039
and this case thoroughly investigated.

558
00:24:26,599 --> 00:24:27,480
A temporary loss of treasury revenue

559
00:24:27,759 --> 00:24:29,119
is a minor matter,

560
00:24:29,119 --> 00:24:30,079
but the integrity of the court

561
00:24:31,559 --> 00:24:32,799
must be upheld.

562
00:24:38,559 --> 00:24:40,039
The salt reform concerns
the foundation of the state.

563
00:24:40,279 --> 00:24:41,960
How can it be abandoned
because of one man?

564
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:43,240
Issue my decree.

565
00:24:43,799 --> 00:24:44,960
The affairs of salt administration

566
00:24:44,960 --> 00:24:46,319
shall temporarily be placed
under the Ministry of Revenue.

567
00:24:46,759 --> 00:24:47,519
Zhao Ling

568
00:24:50,559 --> 00:24:51,960
is to be suspended from office
and imprisoned.

569
00:24:52,559 --> 00:24:53,359
Investigate!

570
00:24:53,519 --> 00:24:55,240
Conduct a full
and thorough investigation!

571
00:24:55,839 --> 00:24:57,599
Your Majesty, please reconsider.

572
00:25:08,240 --> 00:25:10,400
A wise decision, Your Majesty!

573
00:25:24,759 --> 00:25:25,279
Search!

574
00:25:25,279 --> 00:25:27,200
(Xie Residence)

575
00:25:31,320 --> 00:25:32,800
(Xie Residence)

576
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,279
My Lord.

577
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:44,759
I beg you, My Lord,

578
00:25:44,759 --> 00:25:45,559
to show us some mercy.

579
00:25:45,880 --> 00:25:47,119
The lady in this residence

580
00:25:47,119 --> 00:25:48,519
is an old acquaintance
of our young master.

581
00:25:49,119 --> 00:25:50,119
Please, My Lord,

582
00:25:50,839 --> 00:25:51,720
spare her some hardship.

583
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:53,119
I cannot.

584
00:25:55,039 --> 00:25:55,880
Young Lord Yu,

585
00:25:56,400 --> 00:25:57,920
it is not that I refuse your kindness,

586
00:25:58,039 --> 00:25:58,720
but

587
00:25:59,319 --> 00:26:00,799
regarding the confiscation
of the Zhao estate,

588
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:02,559
your father

589
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:04,000
has already given us instructions
beforehand.

590
00:26:04,759 --> 00:26:06,079
As for this money you offer,

591
00:26:06,079 --> 00:26:06,920
I

592
00:26:07,759 --> 00:26:09,240
dare not accept it.

593
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:21,119
Move!

594
00:26:22,079 --> 00:26:22,720
Stay down!

595
00:26:23,160 --> 00:26:24,000
Get down! Down!

596
00:26:24,599 --> 00:26:25,359
Get down now!

597
00:26:25,599 --> 00:26:26,359
Down!

598
00:26:31,319 --> 00:26:32,160
Madam,

599
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:33,920
we've already sent word to Madam Wang.

600
00:26:33,920 --> 00:26:35,039
Why hasn't she arrived yet?

601
00:26:35,039 --> 00:26:35,519
Don't panic.

602
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:37,359
Just stall them until they get here.

603
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:38,799
At least we'll be safe for now.

604
00:26:38,799 --> 00:26:39,240
Down!

605
00:26:39,319 --> 00:26:39,880
Get down!

606
00:26:40,279 --> 00:26:41,000
Spare us!

607
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:41,279
Come here.

608
00:26:41,559 --> 00:26:41,880
Sanniang!

609
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:42,799
Parasites feeding off the court!

610
00:26:43,039 --> 00:26:44,759
Spare me the act of loyalty
between master and servant!

611
00:26:45,119 --> 00:26:46,759
Do you know the salt you consume
every day

612
00:26:47,319 --> 00:26:49,480
was bought with the Zhao couple's
dirty money?

613
00:26:49,480 --> 00:26:50,759
How dare you slander us!

614
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:52,160
You haven't even investigated,

615
00:26:52,359 --> 00:26:53,839
yet you call us parasites!

616
00:26:53,839 --> 00:26:54,640
Our lady's

617
00:26:54,640 --> 00:26:56,000
family is the Xie family of Jiangnan.

618
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:57,480
She has every right to her
own family assets!

619
00:26:57,480 --> 00:26:57,799
Exactly!

620
00:26:57,799 --> 00:26:58,480
That's right!

621
00:26:59,119 --> 00:27:00,359
This case has not yet been decided.

622
00:27:00,799 --> 00:27:02,160
We are merely cooperating
with the investigation,

623
00:27:02,279 --> 00:27:03,519
not convicted criminals.

624
00:27:03,799 --> 00:27:05,240
Since there is no imperial decree
declaring us guilty,

625
00:27:05,559 --> 00:27:07,279
you officers should stop
making things difficult for us.

626
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:08,839
Even these clothes were bought
with the people's money.

627
00:27:08,839 --> 00:27:09,319
Take it off!

628
00:27:09,319 --> 00:27:10,119
What are you doing?

629
00:27:10,240 --> 00:27:11,279
What are you doing?

630
00:27:11,799 --> 00:27:13,039
Don't touch our lady!

631
00:27:13,440 --> 00:27:14,880
How can you be so cruel?

632
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:16,480
You're trying to ruin
my young madam's reputation!

633
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,440
How dare you!

634
00:27:18,119 --> 00:27:18,880
Sanniang!

635
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:19,480
Madam!

636
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:20,640
Stop!

637
00:27:24,759 --> 00:27:26,440
I advise you all to act according
to the law.

638
00:27:26,960 --> 00:27:29,039
If you intend to take advantage
of this situation and bully these women,

639
00:27:29,119 --> 00:27:30,319
you'll have to get through us first!

640
00:27:30,519 --> 00:27:31,920
Confiscating the estate is one thing.

641
00:27:32,119 --> 00:27:33,519
Did His Majesty ever decree

642
00:27:33,519 --> 00:27:34,920
that you could harass the women
of the household?

643
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:36,119
Ransack and rob their home?

644
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:37,079
Did he ever order you

645
00:27:37,079 --> 00:27:38,279
to strip women in public?

646
00:27:38,359 --> 00:27:40,160
Exactly!

647
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:41,119
Who gave you the right?

648
00:27:41,359 --> 00:27:42,079
And you!

649
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:43,119
If your mother

650
00:27:43,119 --> 00:27:44,319
knew what you've been doing out here,

651
00:27:44,319 --> 00:27:45,319
bullying women like this,

652
00:27:45,319 --> 00:27:46,799
she'd crawl out of her grave
to stop you.

653
00:27:46,799 --> 00:27:47,240
You...

654
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:48,000
What!

655
00:27:48,079 --> 00:27:48,880
You all look like decent men,

656
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:50,000
but you behave like animals,

657
00:27:50,079 --> 00:27:51,640
doing such filthy things.

658
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:53,640
If you have the courage, go fight
the enemy at the frontier.

659
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:54,559
Don't show off your power here.

660
00:27:54,559 --> 00:27:55,519
What kind of men are you?

661
00:27:55,599 --> 00:27:56,680
Exactly!

662
00:27:56,680 --> 00:27:58,039
What kind of men are you?

663
00:27:58,039 --> 00:27:58,599
Enough!

664
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:03,680
Follow the proper procedure.

665
00:28:04,359 --> 00:28:05,240
Madam Zhao,

666
00:28:05,519 --> 00:28:06,400
remove your jewelry

667
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:07,480
and come with us.

668
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:09,400
The remaining servants

669
00:28:09,759 --> 00:28:10,759
will be detained according to the law

670
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:11,799
pending further orders.

671
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:15,880
Madam.

672
00:28:16,200 --> 00:28:16,880
It's alright.

673
00:28:16,880 --> 00:28:17,240
Let's go.

674
00:28:18,920 --> 00:28:19,519
Sanniang.

675
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:25,559
Madam.

676
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:26,440
Madam.

677
00:28:26,599 --> 00:28:27,119
Madam.

678
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:28,480
Are you alright?

679
00:28:35,119 --> 00:28:36,559
Thank you, Madam,

680
00:28:37,119 --> 00:28:38,359
and all of you sisters,

681
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:39,720
for coming to my aid in my darkest hour.

682
00:28:40,240 --> 00:28:41,920
Don't say that.

683
00:28:42,079 --> 00:28:42,920
No worries.

684
00:28:43,279 --> 00:28:44,559
Leave everything here to us.

685
00:28:52,200 --> 00:28:53,960
All of you are under temporary
contracts,

686
00:28:54,599 --> 00:28:56,079
so you should not have been dragged
into this.

687
00:28:57,680 --> 00:28:58,920
The trouble we face today

688
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,279
was caused by Mr. Zhao and me,

689
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:03,839
and we have put you all
in this position.

690
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:06,200
But rest assured,

691
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:08,400
as long as no verdict has been issued,

692
00:29:09,119 --> 00:29:11,240
no one can sell you off at will.

693
00:29:12,680 --> 00:29:13,480
For now,

694
00:29:14,759 --> 00:29:16,359
you may have to endure some hardship,

695
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:20,160
but when the truth comes to light,

696
00:29:20,720 --> 00:29:21,839
you will all receive

697
00:29:21,839 --> 00:29:22,880
the justice you deserve.

698
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:24,279
Madam, please don't say that.

699
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:25,640
For all these years,

700
00:29:26,400 --> 00:29:28,319
we have followed you and Mr. Zhao,

701
00:29:28,720 --> 00:29:30,720
and you have treated us like family.

702
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:33,440
You have never spoken a harsh word
to us.

703
00:29:33,799 --> 00:29:34,920
Our monthly wages

704
00:29:35,079 --> 00:29:36,920
have never been short by even a penny.

705
00:29:36,920 --> 00:29:38,640
Today, I failed you.

706
00:29:39,279 --> 00:29:40,799
I could not share your burdens

707
00:29:41,319 --> 00:29:42,759
or clear your name.

708
00:29:42,920 --> 00:29:45,279
But we will never betray you!

709
00:29:45,279 --> 00:29:46,319
We will wait for you to return!

710
00:29:46,319 --> 00:29:47,200
We won't leave!

711
00:29:47,200 --> 00:29:47,559
Yes!

712
00:29:47,839 --> 00:29:48,559
That's right, Madam.

713
00:29:48,559 --> 00:29:49,000
Yes!

714
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:49,559
Madam.

715
00:29:49,559 --> 00:29:50,880
We'll wait for you and Mr. Zhao

716
00:29:51,440 --> 00:29:52,640
to have your names cleared

717
00:29:52,799 --> 00:29:53,720
and return safely.

718
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,880
We'll wait for you!

719
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:55,799
We await your return!

720
00:29:55,799 --> 00:29:57,000
We'll wait for you!

721
00:30:03,400 --> 00:30:05,760
(Xie Residence)

722
00:30:13,079 --> 00:30:13,880
It has begun to snow.

723
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:14,920
It's snowing.

724
00:30:18,079 --> 00:30:18,960
There must be an injustice here.

725
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:19,720
Indeed.

726
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:43,800
(Sealed by the Northern Bureau
of the Imperial Guard)

727
00:30:47,359 --> 00:30:48,160
Mr. Zhao.

728
00:30:49,039 --> 00:30:50,480
Someone asked me to inform you that

729
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:52,039
your wife has also been taken
into custody.

730
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:13,799
The offerings,

731
00:31:13,799 --> 00:31:14,559
spirit money,

732
00:31:14,559 --> 00:31:16,160
and Yucheng's favorite
Pear Blossom White wine...

733
00:31:16,599 --> 00:31:17,000
Everything is ready.

734
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:18,039
Look.

735
00:31:18,039 --> 00:31:19,319
Why has it been sealed?

736
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:20,960
Don't look. Let's go.

737
00:31:27,120 --> 00:31:30,400
(Xie Residence)

738
00:31:44,559 --> 00:31:45,200
Madam.

739
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:45,920
Sen is here.

740
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:47,920
Madam.

741
00:31:48,599 --> 00:31:49,720
What exactly happened?

742
00:31:50,559 --> 00:31:52,799
It was Jin Yuanbao. He submitted
a memorial to the court,

743
00:31:53,160 --> 00:31:54,759
accusing Zhao Ling
of three major crimes.

744
00:31:55,160 --> 00:31:55,960
First,

745
00:31:56,480 --> 00:31:58,680
colluding with Chief Merchant Ye
to sell illicit salt.

746
00:31:58,759 --> 00:31:59,519
Second,

747
00:32:00,079 --> 00:32:01,920
forcing salt merchants to hand
over half of their profits

748
00:32:01,920 --> 00:32:02,799
as so-called "tea money."

749
00:32:02,960 --> 00:32:03,799
Third,

750
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:07,880
he dug up Zhao Ling's past before
he joined the army,

751
00:32:07,880 --> 00:32:09,279
claiming that he had once dealt
in illicit salt.

752
00:32:09,559 --> 00:32:11,279
He also presented

753
00:32:11,279 --> 00:32:12,720
land deeds bearing Zhao Ling's
private seal as evidence.

754
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:14,920
With truth and lies mixed together,

755
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:15,920
it will be difficult to refute.

756
00:32:15,920 --> 00:32:16,559
Impossible!

757
00:32:17,119 --> 00:32:18,839
Brother Yuanbao was the one
who sent me to Yuzhou

758
00:32:19,279 --> 00:32:20,680
to pick up the offerings
for Brother Yucheng's memorial rite.

759
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:21,839
That's why I left the capital.

760
00:32:22,640 --> 00:32:24,279
How could he betray Mr. Zhao?

761
00:32:25,119 --> 00:32:25,799
Sen.

762
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,079
People change.

763
00:32:38,039 --> 00:32:39,079
This staff

764
00:32:39,079 --> 00:32:40,960
was repaired for you
by Commander Zhao himself.

765
00:32:41,799 --> 00:32:43,559
He originally planned to give it to you

766
00:32:43,559 --> 00:32:44,240
at your wedding.

767
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:46,480
But sadly, he is now behind bars.

768
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:48,720
You should keep it

769
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:51,759
for now.

770
00:33:13,359 --> 00:33:14,000
Madam.

771
00:33:14,319 --> 00:33:15,559
Can you save Mr. Zhao?

772
00:33:17,200 --> 00:33:18,960
I will repay your kindness
for the rest of my life.

773
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:21,319
Get up.

774
00:33:25,240 --> 00:33:27,279
Our lord is doing everything he can
to help him.

775
00:33:27,799 --> 00:33:28,640
If the worst comes to pass,

776
00:33:29,319 --> 00:33:30,880
the Wang family will do everything
in our power to protect you.

777
00:33:31,799 --> 00:33:33,240
Your marriage

778
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,519
will not be affected.

779
00:33:42,359 --> 00:33:43,599
How did it come to this?

780
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:12,480
Yu...

781
00:34:13,280 --> 00:34:13,800
Yu...

782
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:18,199
Mr. Jin.

783
00:34:18,440 --> 00:34:19,440
Sorry to keep you waiting.

784
00:34:20,880 --> 00:34:21,679
Where is the Grand Secretary?

785
00:34:23,239 --> 00:34:23,920
Where is he?

786
00:34:24,159 --> 00:34:25,559
My Lord is tied up
with official matters.

787
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:27,519
He simply cannot spare the time.

788
00:34:27,880 --> 00:34:28,880
Whatever you need,

789
00:34:29,039 --> 00:34:30,320
you may tell me instead.

790
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:36,480
I came here because

791
00:34:36,960 --> 00:34:38,440
of the Zhao family's situation.

792
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:40,440
The Grand Secretary promised me

793
00:34:40,519 --> 00:34:41,360
at most,

794
00:34:41,559 --> 00:34:42,320
it would only be

795
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:43,840
exile to the border.

796
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:45,679
How did it end up becoming

797
00:34:46,039 --> 00:34:48,119
imprisonment and confiscation
of his entire estate?

798
00:34:50,559 --> 00:34:51,599
Some things

799
00:34:52,519 --> 00:34:53,679
are like this tea.

800
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:56,400
Once swallowed,

801
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:58,119
can it ever be brought back up?

802
00:35:05,280 --> 00:35:06,360
Mr. Jin.

803
00:35:08,320 --> 00:35:09,599
The tea has gone cold.

804
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:35,480
My Lord.

805
00:35:53,559 --> 00:35:54,559
Sen is here.

806
00:36:01,159 --> 00:36:02,280
Yucheng's offerings...

807
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:03,599
For the memorial rite, are all prepared?

808
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:07,960
Why did you lie to me?

809
00:36:08,599 --> 00:36:09,480
What did I lie to you about?

810
00:36:09,480 --> 00:36:10,880
You deliberately sent me to Yuzhou.

811
00:36:11,480 --> 00:36:12,159
Tell me!

812
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:13,880
Why did you betray Mr. Zhao?

813
00:36:14,159 --> 00:36:15,320
What are you talking about?
Betray Mr. Zhao?

814
00:36:15,320 --> 00:36:16,400
Who filled your head with that nonsense?

815
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:17,400
I'm not a child anymore!

816
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:18,480
I'm eighteen now!

817
00:36:19,360 --> 00:36:21,079
Why do you always keep me in the dark

818
00:36:21,079 --> 00:36:21,960
whenever something happens to you?

819
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:22,760
Why?

820
00:36:29,800 --> 00:36:32,159
Mr. Zhao stood in the way
of too many people.

821
00:36:32,400 --> 00:36:34,239
Even if I hadn't reported him,

822
00:36:34,719 --> 00:36:36,639
someone else would have.

823
00:36:37,199 --> 00:36:38,840
If someone else can claim this fortune,

824
00:36:39,840 --> 00:36:41,639
why can't it be mine?

825
00:36:43,519 --> 00:36:45,280
So it was money after all.

826
00:36:45,719 --> 00:36:47,039
What else is there to live for?

827
00:36:48,639 --> 00:36:50,400
If not for money, then what?

828
00:36:59,920 --> 00:37:01,320
If you had ever had to rely on yourself

829
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:02,800
to survive even a single day
in this world,

830
00:37:02,800 --> 00:37:04,000
you would never ask such a question!

831
00:37:13,559 --> 00:37:15,599
Ever since Mr. Zhao came to the capital,

832
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:18,079
has he ever truly treated me,
Jin Yuanbao, like a brother?

833
00:37:18,320 --> 00:37:20,440
He humiliated me in front
of his own men.

834
00:37:20,440 --> 00:37:20,719
He...

835
00:37:20,719 --> 00:37:21,800
Sen, what are you doing?

836
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:22,679
Withdraw the complaint!

837
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:29,599
I went to see Grand Secretary Yu.

838
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:33,559
But he refused to see me.

839
00:37:34,559 --> 00:37:35,920
When I was useful,

840
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:37,960
they treated me like I mattered.

841
00:37:38,400 --> 00:37:39,639
But when they no longer needed me,

842
00:37:39,639 --> 00:37:41,480
who ever saw me as a person?

843
00:37:43,920 --> 00:37:46,840
Every single one of them is the same.

844
00:37:48,039 --> 00:37:49,519
Sen, open your eyes and see clearly.

845
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:53,559
People prey on each other.

846
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,760
That's the world we live in!

847
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:07,840
I sent you to Yuzhou

848
00:38:09,960 --> 00:38:12,360
because I still cared
about our brotherhood.

849
00:38:13,199 --> 00:38:14,719
If it weren't for me, Jin Yuanbao,

850
00:38:15,280 --> 00:38:17,639
you'd be rotting in prison
with Mr. Zhao right now.

851
00:38:27,360 --> 00:38:28,639
Ever since we were kids,

852
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:32,000
you all made me train
with a staff instead of a blade.

853
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:33,280
You said it was because you didn't
want me to get blood on my hands.

854
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:35,280
So I only trained with a staff.

855
00:38:36,119 --> 00:38:37,199
But even a staff...

856
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:42,039
can still kill.

857
00:39:03,679 --> 00:39:07,440
I've already done everything I could,
in good conscience!

858
00:39:07,559 --> 00:39:10,400
You can't ask anything more of me!

859
00:39:12,719 --> 00:39:13,639
Brother Yuanbao.

860
00:39:15,719 --> 00:39:16,880
I truly thought

861
00:39:19,519 --> 00:39:21,440
we'd be brothers for life.

862
00:39:50,559 --> 00:39:51,320
Sen.

863
00:39:53,679 --> 00:39:54,320
Sen.

864
00:39:55,079 --> 00:39:55,800
Sen.

865
00:39:58,440 --> 00:39:59,039
Let me see.

866
00:40:01,559 --> 00:40:02,360
Thank goodness.

867
00:40:03,039 --> 00:40:04,480
Thank goodness you didn't
do anything foolish.

868
00:40:12,039 --> 00:40:14,760
Mr. Zhao found me between three trees.

869
00:40:16,760 --> 00:40:17,920
Brother Yuanbao said,

870
00:40:18,599 --> 00:40:19,760
"Let's call him Sen."

871
00:40:22,039 --> 00:40:24,239
Mr. Zhao wasn't the only one
who raised me.

872
00:40:27,079 --> 00:40:27,920
They said

873
00:40:28,840 --> 00:40:30,119
that after I came into their lives,

874
00:40:31,400 --> 00:40:33,159
the brothers became less ruthless.

875
00:40:35,079 --> 00:40:36,480
Even though they dealt in illicit salt,

876
00:40:37,320 --> 00:40:38,840
they never became mere thugs.

877
00:41:07,480 --> 00:41:09,679
Jin Yuanbao...

878
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,599
If back then,

879
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,119
you had accepted your place,

880
00:41:15,719 --> 00:41:17,280
and simply stayed

881
00:41:18,360 --> 00:41:20,000
in Huaying,

882
00:41:20,800 --> 00:41:23,079
as a shopkeeper,

883
00:41:28,119 --> 00:41:30,400
you wouldn't have ended up
like this today...

884
00:41:30,679 --> 00:41:32,639
losing an ear,

885
00:41:34,360 --> 00:41:36,559
losing a whole group of brothers,

886
00:41:37,119 --> 00:41:38,320
and now,

887
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:41,480
you still have to

888
00:41:42,159 --> 00:41:44,679
fight for this wretched life of yours.

889
00:42:03,360 --> 00:42:04,679
Grand Secretary Yu

890
00:42:05,280 --> 00:42:06,639
was right.

891
00:42:09,360 --> 00:42:11,039
In this world,

892
00:42:12,639 --> 00:42:14,639
you either devour others,

893
00:42:15,960 --> 00:42:16,719
or...

894
00:42:17,920 --> 00:42:20,000
you let yourself be devoured.

895
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:22,000
I...

896
00:42:24,239 --> 00:42:26,599
I did nothing wrong.

897
00:42:45,079 --> 00:42:46,719
Please, do me this favor.

898
00:42:47,039 --> 00:42:48,360
Just give you the time it takes
for one incense stick to burn.

899
00:42:48,440 --> 00:42:49,039
Make it quick.

900
00:42:52,239 --> 00:42:53,000
Madam Zhao!

901
00:42:59,039 --> 00:43:00,079
Sister, I must say,

902
00:43:00,239 --> 00:43:01,480
you're surprisingly generous today.

903
00:43:01,599 --> 00:43:03,599
You've fallen into such a predicament,

904
00:43:03,800 --> 00:43:05,760
yet you still have the heart
to joke around?

905
00:43:08,480 --> 00:43:09,480
It's nothing.

906
00:43:10,480 --> 00:43:12,440
I've survived worse than this.

907
00:43:13,199 --> 00:43:14,320
Why would I fear this?

908
00:43:17,440 --> 00:43:18,159
These

909
00:43:18,320 --> 00:43:19,360
are from Madam Wang.

910
00:43:19,360 --> 00:43:21,559
She sent clothes and money for you.

911
00:43:21,559 --> 00:43:22,920
She specifically asked us to tell you

912
00:43:22,920 --> 00:43:24,480
that she will take good care of Sen.

913
00:43:25,199 --> 00:43:25,760
She wants you to

914
00:43:26,079 --> 00:43:27,400
take care of yourself.

915
00:43:28,920 --> 00:43:29,880
Listen to me.

916
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:30,960
If it comes down to it,

917
00:43:30,960 --> 00:43:31,760
put everything

918
00:43:31,760 --> 00:43:33,239
on Commander Zhao.

919
00:43:33,840 --> 00:43:34,719
He loves you so much.

920
00:43:34,719 --> 00:43:35,679
He would never blame you.

921
00:43:36,480 --> 00:43:37,519
As women,

922
00:43:37,519 --> 00:43:38,639
no matter what happens,

923
00:43:38,639 --> 00:43:39,920
we can never give up on ourselves.

924
00:43:40,320 --> 00:43:42,079
You have to survive.

925
00:43:45,840 --> 00:43:47,119
He cares for me.

926
00:43:48,159 --> 00:43:49,800
Then I have to care for him too.

927
00:43:55,079 --> 00:43:56,480
Don't worry, sisters.

928
00:43:57,440 --> 00:43:58,599
I know what I'm doing.

929
00:44:00,599 --> 00:44:02,800
What a miserable place this is.

930
00:44:03,159 --> 00:44:05,400
It's not even as good as Gannin.

931
00:44:06,239 --> 00:44:09,039
If only we were all still in Gannin.

932
00:44:09,039 --> 00:44:10,679
General Mo wouldn't have died.

933
00:44:11,360 --> 00:44:13,280
General Zhao's estate wouldn't
have been confiscated.

934
00:44:13,840 --> 00:44:15,719
Nothing would have changed.

935
00:44:19,480 --> 00:44:20,239
Yes.

936
00:44:23,599 --> 00:44:24,719
But in this world,

937
00:44:26,840 --> 00:44:28,280
there's no going back.

938
00:44:33,320 --> 00:44:35,840
(Next Episode)

939
00:44:36,199 --> 00:44:37,360
Mr. Zhao...

940
00:44:38,280 --> 00:44:39,239
He's gone.

941
00:44:40,559 --> 00:44:41,159
She...

942
00:44:42,719 --> 00:44:43,639
She's really all right?

943
00:44:44,559 --> 00:44:46,639
Some people fight their way up,

944
00:44:46,719 --> 00:44:47,679
while others

945
00:44:47,679 --> 00:44:49,480
fear being replaced.

946
00:44:50,239 --> 00:44:51,679
What matters most right now

947
00:44:51,760 --> 00:44:52,920
is that we find out

948
00:44:52,920 --> 00:44:55,239
what Zhao Ling has really been up to.

949
00:44:55,760 --> 00:44:57,760
If you try to stir up more trouble,

950
00:44:58,159 --> 00:45:00,079
I'm afraid the final outcome

951
00:45:02,119 --> 00:45:05,159
will be far worse than just drinking
this bowl of chastity soup.

952
00:45:17,921 --> 00:45:22,241
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

953
00:45:25,841 --> 00:45:30,201
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

954
00:45:32,321 --> 00:45:36,961
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

955
00:45:37,201 --> 00:45:40,001
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

956
00:45:41,161 --> 00:45:45,801
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

957
00:45:49,001 --> 00:45:55,841
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

958
00:45:56,721 --> 00:46:03,241
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

959
00:46:04,201 --> 00:46:07,641
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

960
00:46:08,161 --> 00:46:12,361
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

961
00:46:12,641 --> 00:46:18,321
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

962
00:46:30,441 --> 00:46:34,321
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

963
00:46:38,241 --> 00:46:42,241
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

964
00:46:43,961 --> 00:46:48,641
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

965
00:46:48,961 --> 00:46:51,641
♪Kept close within my heart♪

966
00:46:52,721 --> 00:46:57,561
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

967
00:47:01,081 --> 00:47:08,001
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

968
00:47:08,881 --> 00:47:15,361
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

969
00:47:16,241 --> 00:47:19,761
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

970
00:47:20,201 --> 00:47:24,561
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

971
00:47:24,761 --> 00:47:30,481
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

